                                        "sense_id": "7ce6c1a4-d77f-32dd-8e26-633b8a511d16",
                                        "entry_id": "b4b6d85f-3e74-3dee-bcae-dd66574d7eb9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To infest, swarm over, flow over."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e81a42f6-b516-4d6b-844a-6b49434e2fca",
                                                "sense_id": "7ce6c1a4-d77f-32dd-8e26-633b8a511d16",
                                                "text": "The vine overran its trellis; the field is overrun with weeds."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46bdcdd2-2a36-4a75-9984-7b09694addd8",
                                                "sense_id": "7ce6c1a4-d77f-32dd-8e26-633b8a511d16",
                                                "text": "those barbarous nations that over-ran the world"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ab02b4e-53db-4c7b-8002-08014a537168",
                                                "sense_id": "7ce6c1a4-d77f-32dd-8e26-633b8a511d16",
                                                "text": "As President Obama turns his attention once again to filling out a cabinet and writing an Inaugural Address, this much is clear: he should not expect to bask in a surge of national unity, or to witness a crowd of millions overrun the Mall just to say they were there."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fd88968e-9a08-3815-ab2a-858cc1a7ee10",
                                        "entry_id": "b4b6d85f-3e74-3dee-bcae-dd66574d7eb9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To run past; to run beyond."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9d1beeb-0a21-4958-ae50-d955f610a9ff",
                                                "sense_id": "fd88968e-9a08-3815-ab2a-858cc1a7ee10",
                                                "text": "The athlete overran the finish line and kept going."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91f3eeb3-1e40-49ff-89a0-e715098002b3",
                                                "sense_id": "fd88968e-9a08-3815-ab2a-858cc1a7ee10",
                                                "text": "One line overruns another in length."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0c5798aa-ef36-4a6e-a03c-8e19d9e66dd8",
                                                "sense_id": "fd88968e-9a08-3815-ab2a-858cc1a7ee10",
                                                "text": "Ahimaaz ran by the way of the plain, and overran Cushi."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8cd08ae-ca8a-42b7-9b21-fb19818e3903",
                                                "sense_id": "fd88968e-9a08-3815-ab2a-858cc1a7ee10",
                                                "text": "The collision occurred when an up empty electric train travelling on the up main through line overran the inner home signal and rammed the side of the departing 6.14 p.m. Waterloo-Weymouth steam train, which was leaving platform 12 for the down main through line."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7fc2d51c-4174-361a-80b4-27685dcb0ddb",
                                        "entry_id": "b4b6d85f-3e74-3dee-bcae-dd66574d7eb9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To run past; to run beyond.",
                                            "To run past the end of."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86ee5ef5-b343-41da-a88f-2351c5ded195",
                                                "sense_id": "7fc2d51c-4174-361a-80b4-27685dcb0ddb",
                                                "text": "The aircraft didn't stop in time and overran the runway."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1fd12e0e-f8d7-3c04-a76b-cc228d8038d3",
                                        "entry_id": "b4b6d85f-3e74-3dee-bcae-dd66574d7eb9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To continue for too long."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1a9130f-414f-4734-857a-d41618aea93a",
                                                "sense_id": "1fd12e0e-f8d7-3c04-a76b-cc228d8038d3",
                                                "text": "The performance overran by ten minutes, which caused some people to miss their bus home."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8c5c2a87-efe2-3846-8881-0ffc8939d435",
                                        "entry_id": "b4b6d85f-3e74-3dee-bcae-dd66574d7eb9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To carry (some type, a line or column, etc.) backward or forward into an adjacent line or page."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ea000091-cb11-3bc6-b6a2-8b20ddea9432",
                                        "entry_id": "b4b6d85f-3e74-3dee-bcae-dd66574d7eb9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To go beyond; to extend in part beyond."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "459ad79b-0fb5-4944-9d99-9efb693f1c3f",
                                                "sense_id": "ea000091-cb11-3bc6-b6a2-8b20ddea9432",
                                                "text": "In machinery, a sliding piece is said to overrun its bearing when its forward end goes beyond it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03e9c7bc-945a-4fab-9da8-c061c842e5e7",
                                                "sense_id": "ea000091-cb11-3bc6-b6a2-8b20ddea9432",
                                                "text": "all of these services, including mSpy, function with the same kind of predatory subscription scheme, luring you in with free trials that autorenew as abhorrently expensive monthly or yearly subscriptions. canceling the service requires reaching out to support, so users are typically unable to avoid overrunning the trial."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d3ffd3a5-01a1-30f0-b7ff-93e48ac79b48",
                                        "entry_id": "b4b6d85f-3e74-3dee-bcae-dd66574d7eb9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To abuse or oppress, as if by treading upon."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80402fd3-891a-4326-874c-08048ebb79f1",
                                                "sense_id": "d3ffd3a5-01a1-30f0-b7ff-93e48ac79b48",
                                                "text": "None of them the feeble overren."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
